OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings flooding and
OL,4,Acancelled flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo has brought strong winds,
OL,7,Fflooding and travel disruption to
OL,8,FYorkshire.
OL,10,FA yellow weather alert for wind remains
OL,11,Fin place until 21:00 GMT.
OL,13,FThousands of homes are still without
OL,14,Fpower, while Leeds Bradford Airport -
OL,15,Fthe UK's highest commercial airport -
OL,16,Fcancelled several flights on Sunday and
OL,17,Fdiverted many more.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
