OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings flooding and
OL,4,Acancelled flights
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been a similar picture across
OL,7,Fthe UK. One man died in Scotland and
OL,8,Fthere has been widespread travel
OL,9,Fdisruption, with gusts of up to 85mph
OL,10,F(137 km/h) in exposed areas.
